      {
        "t": "mistake",
        "html": "Missing the root when a prefix changes the look of the word. <b>submit</b> is <i>sub-</i> + <i>mit</i> (send under: give in). <b>demise</b> is <i>de-</i> + <i>mis</i> (a sending away: an end or death). <b>premise</b> is <i>pre-</i> + <i>mis</i>, a statement sent ahead of the argument."
